{"nodes": [{"id": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "label": "Canary Maze Implementation Contract", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hackathon mode, direct channel. Before/after: the operator moves from 'these clients look similar' to holding a dated record that a specific secret moved between two request contexts, plus a bundle that verifies with their server switched off."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_1", "label": "AC-1 Human Requests Never Mint and Never Enter the Ledger", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN a request carries browser headers (Accept-Language plus any Sec-Fetch-*) THE SYSTEM SHALL NOT mint and SHALL NOT write any ledger row. Verified by pytest tests/test_gate.py. This is a correctness requirement, not a nicety: per-visitor minting applied to humans would make this a tracking tool."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_2", "label": "AC-2 Idempotent Mint Within a Salt Epoch", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN the same context requests the same path twice in one salt epoch THE SYSTEM SHALL return the same secret and write exactly one mint row. Verified by pytest tests/test_mint.py."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_3", "label": "AC-3 Same-Context Canary Fetch Writes No Sighting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN a canary URL is requested by the context it was minted for THE SYSTEM SHALL return 200 and SHALL NOT write a sighting. Verified by pytest tests/test_detect.py."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_4", "label": "AC-4 Cross-Context Canary Fetch Writes Exactly One Sighting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN a canary URL is requested by a different context THE SYSTEM SHALL return 200 and SHALL write exactly one sighting carrying both raw request rows. Verified by pytest tests/test_detect.py. The stable canary URL space must return 200 for any context or no sighting is possible."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_5", "label": "AC-5 Altered Bytes Fail Verification and Name the Row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN any byte of any bundled row is altered THE SYSTEM SHALL fail verification and SHALL name the failing row. Verified by pytest tests/test_bundle.py."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_6", "label": "AC-6 Verifier Makes No Network Call and Needs No Server", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN the verifier runs THE SYSTEM SHALL make no network call and SHALL NOT require the server. Verified by make verify with the server stopped. This is the whole wedge: the record checks out without trusting the recorder."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_7", "label": "AC-7 Model Disabled Yields a Byte-Identical Proof Graph", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN the model is disabled THE SYSTEM SHALL produce a byte-identical proof graph. Verified by scripts/verify.sh --compare-model-off. Lets a judge switch the model off and diff."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_8", "label": "AC-8 Viewer Separates Organic, Seeded and Human Counts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN the viewer renders THE SYSTEM SHALL display organic and seeded sighting counts separately and the human-requests-in-ledger count. Verified by make demo then asserting on viewer/data.json."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_ac_9", "label": "AC-9 Clean Offline Checkout Produces the Viewer and Prints PASS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WHEN make demo is run on a clean checkout with no network THE SYSTEM SHALL produce the viewer and print PASS."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_j1_mint", "label": "Journey J1 Mint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An automated client requests a maze page, the gate classifies it automated, a secret is minted for its context, the page embeds that secret's canary URL, and a mint row plus the raw request are persisted."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_j2_sight", "label": "Journey J2 Sight", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A different context requests that canary URL, it returns 200, and a sighting row is written linking both contexts and both raw requests."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_j3_prove", "label": "Journey J3 Prove", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The operator exports a bundle, a third party runs the verifier offline, and it recomputes the Merkle root and confirms, or names the row that fails. Offline is the normal case for this journey, not a degraded one."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_human_exclusion_gate", "label": "Human-Exclusion Gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Humans are never minted for and never enter the ledger. Forced by the privacy constraint: per-visitor minting applied to humans would be a tracking tool. IPs are truncated to /24 before storage and humans are never stored at all."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_maze_pages", "label": "Maze Pages Surface", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only way an automated client is issued a secret. Plumbing; never demoed."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_canary_route", "label": "Canary Route Surface", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The sighting channel. Must return 200 for every context."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_viewer", "label": "Viewer Surface", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The product: the claim, the figure, the records, verification, honesty counters."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_export_json", "label": "GET /export.json", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feeds the viewer and the bundle."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_cli", "label": "CLI (seed-replay, export-bundle, verify-bundle, trigger-paste)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The deterministic path a judge can run offline."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_request_entity", "label": "request Entity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Append-only SQLite row; IP stored truncated to /24, humans never stored."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_mint_entity", "label": "mint Entity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Binds secret to context, path, salt epoch, timestamp and the raw request."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_sighting_entity", "label": "sighting Entity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Links mint context and seen context plus both raw request rows and the elapsed delta."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_laundered_entity", "label": "laundered Entity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A separate table that is never joined into the proof graph, disabled by default. Semantic matching of paraphrased tokens is explicitly out of this build."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_zero_inference_budget", "label": "Zero Inference Budget Constraint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GBP 0 inference: the proof path must not call a model. Compute reimbursement is in-person only and this builder is online, so there is no credit to spend."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_assumption_a_1_organic_crawlers", "label": "Assumption A-1: Automated Clients Will Reach a New Domain Quickly", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Safe. Validated at run time by the organic counter and reported honestly whatever it says, rather than asserted."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_assumption_a_2_context_stability", "label": "Assumption A-2: Context Identity From UA Plus /24 Plus Header Shape Is Stable Enough", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Safe. Documented as an assumption in the README, not claimed as fact, because same-context re-fetch detection depends on it."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_assumption_a_4_write_the_maze", "label": "Assumption A-4 Resolved: Write the Maze Rather Than Fork Pyison", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Was blocking, now resolved by ADR-0003. The maze is never demoed, forking an unfamiliar repo was the critic's named time risk, and ~60 lines fully understood beats a dependency for the one component with no judged surface."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_demo_script", "label": "Demo Script", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a711", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordered to earn specific criteria: claim sentence for theme fit and presentation, the marked record pair as the product moment, stopping the server and running make verify as the wow moment, the model-off byte-identical diff for execution, the 741-address unhappy path for honesty and originality, and the honesty counters for real results and trust."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_wont_claim_two_contexts_are_two_actors", "label": "WON'T: Claim That Two Contexts Are Two Actors", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explicitly excluded along with any blocking or mitigation, user accounts, and any queue, cache or second datastore. The scope boundary that ADR-0002 enforces in the schema."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_seeded_two_client_replay", "label": "Seeded Two-Client Replay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The primary deliverable, because organic traffic cannot be guaranteed within the deadline. Labelled seeded on the records themselves and counted separately from organic."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_evidence_bundle_and_offline_verifier", "label": "Evidence Bundle and Offline Verifier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Merkle root over the ledgers, verified with no network and no server. The bundle, not the database, is the durable artifact the operator hands to a third party who does not trust them."}, {"id": "_prod_build_contract_honesty_counters", "label": "Honesty Counters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Organic sightings, seeded sightings and human-requests-in-ledger reported separately, so the tool's own claim can be audited on its face rather than taken on trust."}], "edges": [{"source": "_prod_build_contract_laundered_entity", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_7", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a76, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_viewer", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_8", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a74, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_honesty_counters", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_8", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_cli", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_9", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a74, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_human_exclusion_gate", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_1", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_seeded_two_client_replay", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_9", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_evidence_bundle_and_offline_verifier", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_5", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_evidence_bundle_and_offline_verifier", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_6", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_2", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_5", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_6", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_7", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_8", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_canary_maze_implementation_contract", "target": "_prod_build_contract_ac_9", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_j1_mint", "target": "_prod_build_contract_human_exclusion_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_j1_mint", "target": "_prod_build_contract_maze_pages", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a73, \u00a74", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_j1_mint", "target": "_prod_build_contract_mint_entity", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "source_location": "\u00a73, \u00a76", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_prod_build_contract_j2_sight", "target": "_prod_build_contract_canary_route", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".prod-build/contract.md", "sour